01:01:54,576 --> 01:01:56,656
尽可能增加更多的功能。
Adding as many capabilities as possible.

760
01:01:56,878 --> 01:01:58,016
不对，这个不正确。
Nope, that is not correct.

761
01:01:58,176 --> 01:02:02,656
我们希望我们的智能体尽可能地受限、精简或非常具体。
We want our agents to be scoped or thin or very specific as possible.

