01:02:44,624 --> 01:02:51,664
在设计智能体时最重要的一点是，它要有明确的意图，
非常精简且具体，有明确的目的和范围，并且设有护栏。
thing when designing agents, that it has a clear intent, that it's very
thin and specific, has a purpose and a scope, that it has guardrails.

773
01:02:51,984 --> 01:02:54,464
这意味着基于角色的访问控制。
What that means is role-based access control.

