775
01:02:56,624 --> 01:03:05,904
这意味着它必须设有安全护栏，建立了身份验证，是
安全可靠的，不会产生有害内容，并且拥有范围权限。
That it has security guardrails in place, that it has authentication set up, that it is
safe and secure and doesn't produce harmful content, and that it is scoped permissions.

776
01:03:06,064 --> 01:03:08,516
它不应该有能力做任何事情，对吧？
It doesn't have the ability to do absolutely everything, right?

