比如收到带有特定主题行的邮件，或者创建了一个案例，或者是提交了一个 IT 工单。
So instead of requiring somebody to talk to our agent, you can have the system or an event happen that calls and wakes up your agent,
like the receipt of an email with a certain subject line or the creation of a case or the submission of an IT ticket.

797
01:05:06,304 --> 01:05:16,384
这些是数据驱动的事件，可以触发一个智能体，或者再次说，一个带有指令、
