01:05:19,184 --> 01:05:20,704
我们还有一些被称为技能的东西。
We have these things called skills.

800
01:05:20,864 --> 01:05:26,384
技能本质上是额外的指令，但它们几乎就像知识一样起作用。
Skills are essentially additional instructions, but they almost work as knowledge.

801
01:05:26,574 --> 01:05:34,544
我的意思是，当你构建一个智能体时，你放入指令中的所有内容每次都会传递给 LLM。
And so what I mean by that is when you build an agent, everything
you put in your instructions get passed to the LLM every single time.

802
01:05:34,704 --> 01:05:44,624
所以当我与智能体聊天时，实际上发送给模型的是我的提示词、
该智能体的指令以及我们对话的上下文。
And so when I chat to an agent, the thing that's actually going to the model is my
prompt and the instructions of that agent, as well as the context of our conversation.

803
01:05:44,814 --> 01:05:50,544
然后它会去寻找任何知识，把所有这些信息汇总起来，然后发送给模型来生成输出。
Then it goes and finds any knowledge and takes all of this information and then sends it to the model to produce its output.

804
01:05:50,704 --> 01:05:59,664
可能会出现这种情况：指令仅在人们谈论某一特定类型的任务或特定类型的消息时才适用。
There could be a scenario where instructions only apply when people only
talk about one specific type of task or one specific type of message.

805
01:05:59,824 --> 01:06:01,264
这时我们可以创建一个技能。
Then we can create a skill.

806
01:06:01,434 --> 01:06:04,234
智能体会知道，哦，他们是在问关于某某事的内容。
The agent will know, ooh, they're asking about such and such.

807
01:06:04,334 --> 01:06:06,334
我有一个技能可以帮助我处理某某事。
I have a skill that helps me do such and such.

808
01:06:06,464 --> 01:06:12,784
让我去查看这些指令，基本上把它们加入到我的知识中，以便我能更好地理解一点。
Let me go check out these instructions and add them essentially to my knowledge for me to understand a little bit better.

809
01:06:12,944 --> 01:06:21,664
与其每次都把这些内容包含在你的指令里，而实际上 90%
的时间人们都在谈论不需要这些相关指令的其他任务。
As opposed to just including those in your instructions every single time, when 90% of
the time they're talking about other tasks that don't need those relevant instructions.

810
01:06:21,984 --> 01:06:22,944
这就是技能的作用。
That is what skills are.

811
01:06:23,024 --> 01:06:23,904
这些是 Markdown 文件。
These are markdown files.

812
01:06:23,984 --> 01:06:24,784
你可以添加到你的智能体中。
You can add to your agent.

