So if we have steps one, two, three, and four, and steps two and three really aren't dependent on each other,
we shouldn't use sequential because that's going to make our process slower.

917
01:15:06,704 --> 01:15:12,304
我们可以先做步骤一，然后同时做步骤二和三，最后把所有这些结合到步骤四，可以这么说。
