this was absolutely hit on several times in my exam.

1852
02:30:06,256 --> 02:30:16,736
这就是当我们衡量投资回报率时，我们不能只衡量它节省了多少时间，或者增加了多少钱，
或者降低了多少风险，或者节省了多少成本。
And this is the idea of when we measure return on investment, we can't just measure how much time it saves us or how much money it
