It's what increased the increase in revenue, so to speak, as well as over the increase in expenses.

1855
02:30:26,336 --> 02:30:32,096
如果我们增加了 5% 的营收，但增加了 10% 的支出，我们就有了负的投资回报率。
If we increase the revenue by 5%, but we increase our expenses by 10%, we have a negative return on investment.

1856
02:30:32,238 --> 02:30:40,656
所以这就是我们要理解这个东西花了我们多少钱，这样我们才能把它与它帮助我们获得的收益进
行对比，从而找到合适的投资回报率。
And so it's this idea of how do we understand how much this thing is costing us so we can compare it to how much this thing this thing
is helping us to find a adequate return on investment.

1857
02:30:40,750 --> 02:30:49,668
